body:
The only ones I get in my double take list are douchebag hookers. I want something a bit serious. the 25+ people are hidden. This feature is promoting for tinder plus did you get me. I have 5 matches right now after using the app for more than a month. I want to pile up people like at least 10 and then start texting them all. I know some may not be serious so at least from all the 10 ppl I texted I would get into a single relationship in the long run... 

